@begin(section)

@title(API Reference)

This section details the API provided by dsolv. The packages mirror the
source files: @c(com.djhaskin.dsolv/resolver) holds the resolver data
structures and algorithm, @c(com.djhaskin.dsolv/util) the repository
utilities, and the @c(com.djhaskin.dsolv/pkgsys/*) packages the package
system slurpers.

@begin(section)
@title(@c(com.djhaskin.dsolv))

The main package of the system. Its primary export is @c(main), the entry
point for the CLI tool.

@cl:with-package[name="com.djhaskin.dsolv"](
@begin(section)
@title(@c(main))
@cl:doc(function main)
@end(section)
)
@end(section)

